      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This appears to be an issue with a custom locomotion animator. If other people have this issue please share info on the timing of tracking control state behaviors, pose space state behaviors, or anything else that seems relevant. Multiple screenshots of the relevant parts of the animator would help too.\nEdit: This might also be an issue with the world itself. In any case, I haven't yet been able to reproduce this issue",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
