      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So this issue just seems to be affecting _every_ avatar for me in general with 'Legacy IK' regardless of custom loco controller, avatar 2.0/3.0 etc. It's very apparent when you stop locomoting side to side.\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/uy3g5i.mp4\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/iljwn7.mp4",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
