        "like": 1
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I originally reported the issue as Desktop only and providing my animator setup before Kung gave pointers on what more to test in the discussion channel. \nThe IK setting you choose persists to Desktop, which is most likely what caused confusion when I originally reported it. I was using LegacyIK last time in VR while I assume Kung used Beta IK.\nIssue is known now. Applies to all avatars, Desktop and VR, other than those which happen to disable feet tracking on landing. LegacyIK only- BetaIK works as expected.\nIK setting persisting to Desktop is a separate but known issue. Don’t believe there’s a canny, but Kung knows of it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
