      "value": "@{6161a61a2c0de966b4e43486|full_name}: i think it might be an issue related to the height setting, as it happens similarly with the body floating bug when you are using an incorrect height setting\nbtw i'm in the same situation since update 11711\nhttps://i.imgur.com/CpuI1DB.mp4",
